The normal QML frontend adds Qt Qml, Quick and Quick Controls to the Qt
module inventory. Its development/test dependency graph also includes Qt Test,
Quick Test, SVG, Shader Tools and Language Server, pinned with Qt Base at 6.11.1.

Live video sources add Qt Multimedia 6.11.1 and its FFmpeg media backend.
The official Linux Qt SDK used for local verification bundles FFmpeg 7.1.3;
the pinned vcpkg source graph selects FFmpeg 9.0.1 with different build features.
Source provenance, observed license variants, and upstream license texts are
recorded in THIRD-PARTY-LICENSES/FFmpeg.txt and THIRD-PARTY-LICENSES/FFmpeg/.

